title: $:/plugins/rimir/outline/language/block/

paragraph: Paragraph
heading1: Heading 1
heading2: Heading 2
heading3: Heading 3
bulleted: Bulleted list
numbered: Numbered list
quote: Quote
code: Code block
edit: Edit this line
group-insert: Insert after
group-insert-before: Insert before
empty-hint: Empty. Enter writes a first paragraph, Alt-Enter offers headings, lists and other blocks.
group-convert: Turn into
group-delete: Delete?
delete: Yes, delete
delete-heading: Yes, the heading and its section ($counted$)
delete-list: Yes, the whole list ($counted$)
delete-children: Yes, with its sub-items ($counted$)
delete-container: Yes, with its contents ($counted$)
delete-own: Just the heading
cancel: Cancel (Esc)
count-blocks: $count$ blocks
count-blocks-one: 1 block
count-items: $count$ items
count-items-one: 1 item
count-sub-items: $count$ sub-items
count-sub-items-one: 1 sub-item
